      Naming convention:
        - Shared/generic strings (reused across multiple screens: actions, common content
          descriptions, filter/sort labels, etc.) get short, unprefixed names, e.g. "action_create",
          "cd_restore", "filter_all".
        - Screen- or component-specific copy is prefixed with its owner, e.g. "tasks_screen_title",
          "settings_backup_section_title".
        - Format args use positional placeholders (%1$s, %1$d) so word order can change per string
          without renumbering call sites.
